{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-page-js","path":"/stringify/options/quote_record_delimiter/","result":{"data":{"page":{"html":"<h1 id=\"option-code-classlanguage-textquote_record_delimitercode\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#option-code-classlanguage-textquote_record_delimitercode\" aria-label=\"option code classlanguage textquote_record_delimitercode permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Option <code class=\"language-text\">quote_record_delimiter</code></h1>\n<p>The <code class=\"language-text\">quote_record_delimiter</code> option controls whether fields containing <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code> (carriage return) or <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code> (line feed) are automatically quoted, beyond the configured <a href=\"/stringify/options/record_delimiter/\"><code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code></a> characters which are always quoted.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Type: <code class=\"language-text\">boolean</code></li>\n<li>Optional</li>\n<li>Default: <code class=\"language-text\">true</code> when <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> is not set, <code class=\"language-text\">false</code> when <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> is explicitly configured</li>\n<li>Since: 6.9.0</li>\n<li>Related: <a href=\"/stringify/options/quote/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quote</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/record_delimiter/\"><code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted</code></a> — see <a href=\"/stringify/options/#available-options\">Available Options</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>When <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> is not explicitly configured, <code class=\"language-text\">quote_record_delimiter</code> defaults to <code class=\"language-text\">true</code>. This preserves round-trip safety: while <code class=\"language-text\">stringify</code> only treats <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code> as a record separator by default, <code class=\"language-text\">parse</code> treats all three sequences <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code>, and <code class=\"language-text\">\\r\\n</code> as record boundaries. An unquoted <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code> inside a field would therefore be misread as a record separator on the next parse.</p>\n<p>When <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> is explicitly set, <code class=\"language-text\">quote_record_delimiter</code> defaults to <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>. The assumption is that the user has taken control of their format, so the extra protection for <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code> is not applied automatically. Only fields containing the configured <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> characters are quoted.</p>\n<h2 id=\"default-behavior\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#default-behavior\" aria-label=\"default behavior permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Default behavior</h2>\n<p>With the default configuration (no <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> set), only a field containing a carriage return <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code> or a line feed <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code> is quoted.</p>\n<p><div class=\"gatsby-highlight display-embed-file-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> stringify <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"csv-stringify/sync\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> assert <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"node:assert\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// A carriage return inside a field is quoted by default</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> records <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"a\\rb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"c\\nd\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"e::f\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">eof</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nassert<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>records<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'\"a\\rb\"\\n\"c\\nd\"\\ne::f'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre><div class=\"display-embed-file\"><a href=\"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv/blob/master/packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.quote_record_delimiter_default.js\">./packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.quote_record_delimiter_default.js</a></div></div></p>\n<h2 id=\"with-a-custom-code-classlanguage-textrecord_delimitercode\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#with-a-custom-code-classlanguage-textrecord_delimitercode\" aria-label=\"with a custom code classlanguage textrecord_delimitercode permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>With a custom <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code></h2>\n<p>When <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code> is explicitly configured, <code class=\"language-text\">quote_record_delimiter</code> defaults to <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>. Fields containing <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code> or <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code> are not quoted unless those characters are part of the configured delimiter.</p>\n<p><div class=\"gatsby-highlight display-embed-file-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> stringify <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"csv-stringify/sync\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> assert <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"node:assert\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// When record_delimiter is set, quote_record_delimiter defaults to false.</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// A carriage return is not quoted because it does not match the custom delimiter.</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> cr <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"a\\rb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">record_delimiter</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"::\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">eof</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nassert<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cr<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"a\\rb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// The custom delimiter itself is always quoted.</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> delim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"a::b\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">record_delimiter</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"::\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">eof</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nassert<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>delim<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'\"a::b\"'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre><div class=\"display-embed-file\"><a href=\"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv/blob/master/packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.quote_record_delimiter_default.js\">./packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.quote_record_delimiter_default.js</a></div></div></p>\n<h2 id=\"disabling-the-option\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#disabling-the-option\" aria-label=\"disabling the option permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Disabling the option</h2>\n<p>When <code class=\"language-text\">quote_record_delimiter</code> is explicitly set to <code class=\"language-text\">false</code> with the default <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code>, a carriage return <code class=\"language-text\">\\r</code> is not quoted. A line feed <code class=\"language-text\">\\n</code> is still quoted because it matches the default <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code>.</p>\n<p><div class=\"gatsby-highlight display-embed-file-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> stringify <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"csv-stringify/sync\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> assert <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"node:assert\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// With quote_record_delimiter disabled, a carriage return is not quoted</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> cr <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"a\\rb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">quote_record_delimiter</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">eof</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nassert<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cr<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"a\\rb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// A line feed is still quoted because it matches the default record_delimiter</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> lf <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"a\\nb\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">quote_record_delimiter</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">eof</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nassert<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>lf<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'\"a\\nb\"'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre><div class=\"display-embed-file\"><a href=\"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv/blob/master/packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.quote_record_delimiter_default.js\">./packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.quote_record_delimiter_default.js</a></div></div></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Option quote_record_delimiter","description":"Quote fields containing carriage return or line feed characters to ensure round-trip safety.","keywords":["csv","stringify","options","quote","record","delimiter","carriage return","line feed"]},"headings":[{"id":"default-behavior","depth":2,"value":"Default behavior"},{"id":"with-a-custom-code-classlanguage-textrecord_delimitercode","depth":2,"value":"With a custom <code class=\"language-text\">record_delimiter</code>"},{"id":"disabling-the-option","depth":2,"value":"Disabling the option"}],"fields":{"edit_url":"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv-docs/edit/master/src/md/stringify/options/quote_record_delimiter.md","slug":"/stringify/options/quote_record_delimiter/"}}},"pageContext":{}},"staticQueryHashes":["421902736"],"slicesMap":{}}